E / WAYPOINTS → manage waypoints\n🎒 ITEMS → give/remove tools\n💀 RESPAWN → force death (uncuffs IsCuffed/IsHeld → destroys UpperTorso → HP=0)\nDELETE UI → closes the interface\n🪑 SEAT → appears within ≤40 studs of own vehicle, sits in DriveSeat\nTELEPORT screen\n\nMode buttons:\n\nORBIT ON/OFF\nROTATION ON/OFF\n🐴 HORSE ON/OFF\nDETECTIVES ON/OFF (mirror)\nCANCEL TP / ← BACK\nTabs:\n\nBUILDINGS\nDESTINATIONS\nDEALER\nPLAYERS ← each player card has a 💥 button (spams DestroyedObjects at target, toggle ON/OFF)\nVEHICLES\nCUSTOM VEHICLE screen\n\nPart selection / entire vehicle\nColor palette (20 colors)\nMaterial\nTransparency (slider)\nCastShadow toggle\nSpeed (slider)\nWAYPOINTS screen\n\nCreate / TP / Delete waypoint\nLive position\nExport / Copy / Import\nITEMS screen\n\nTool list from ReplicatedStorage\n🗑 REMOVE ITEM\nSettings Panel\n\nPLAYERS\n\nAtmosphere ON/OFF (visually disables Lighting atmosphere)\nTracer ON/OFF (billboard above players, color based on role)\nTracer line ON/OFF (shows/hides line between self and players)\nTracer distance (slider 50–1000, default 1000)\nAUTO ROB\n\nRob vending machines ON/OFF\nRob jewelry ON/OFF\nPOLICE ARREST\n\nTazed ON/OFF (auto-clears Tazed attribute every 0.5s)\nHandcuffs ON/OFF (auto-clears IsCuffed + IsHeld every 0.5s)\nORBIT KEY\n\nOrbit key (customizable)\nKEYS\n\nAcceleration sim key (customizable)\nReverse sim key (customizable)\nSOUNDS\n\n🐴 Horse sounds ON/OFF\n🚔 Police siren ON/OFF\nHUD\n\n🚔 Police notification ON/OFF\n🏷 Role badge ON/OFF\n👥 Vehicle panel ON/OFF\nPolice detection distance (slider 50–500)\nVEHICLE\n\nVehicle sim ON/OFF\nDetectives distance (6–12 studs, +/− buttons)\nMax forward speed (slider 10–375)\nMax reverse speed (slider 5–30)\nAcceleration (slider 5–220)\nPermanent HUD\n\nRole badge (screen corner)\nPolice notification (proximity alert)\nVehicle occupants panel 👥\nAirborne notification (sim)\nPlayer tracer (lines + role-colored billboards)","tags":["elix","teamelixdec"],"discord":"","keyLink":